      "description": "Integrated core dashboards (Recruiting, IAM, Legal, Accounting, BU Manager, Production) with CSR logic."
    },
    {
      "name": "Dev Environment Orchestration (Tilt)",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Configured Tilt to dynamically discover and run 34 microservices and the frontend."
    },
    {
      "name": "E2E Testing",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Achieved 100% BDD e2e coverage across 244 routes and implemented missing COFOG 10 actor for social protection onboarding."
    },
    {
      "name": "Business Plan Reporting Integration",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Implemented APQC 1.1.2 Business Plan Reporting actor and integrated with the BU Manager dashboard via ConnectRPC."
    },
    {
      "name": "Core to Descriptive Renaming",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Renamed 24 repositories containing 'core' to more descriptive terms (Registry, Baseline, Regulations, etc.) on GitHub and updated internal code references."
    },
    {
      "name": "Submodule Configuration Fix",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Reconstructed .gitmodules to accurately map all 51 tracked submodules in the git index, resolving 'no submodule mapping found' errors."
    },
    {
      "name": "Design System Actor Registration",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Registered etzhayyim-performer-sys-design-system-nfv0g01u as a private repository under etzhayyim organization."
    },
    {
      "name": "Design System Svelte Refactor",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Refactored the design system from React to Svelte 5 components and configured it as a Svelte library."
    },
    {
      "name": "Svelte Type Quality & Infrastructure",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Upgraded Vite to 7.x in root to match submodules, resolved core type conflicts in ClerkProvider, and fixed several ConnectRPC client type mismatches."
    },
    {
      "name": "Team Manager UI Stabilization",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Refactored Team Manager Portal using @digital-go-jp/design-system-example-components-react Svelte components for improved UI/UX consistency."
    },
    {
      "name": "Business Reconciliation Capability",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Implemented APQC 1.3.2 Business Reconciliation actor and Svelte 5 UI for autonomous business state convergence and actor auto-implementation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Market Development Capability Integration",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Implemented Market Development & Business Intelligence capability, added 6 specialized submodules, integrated routes into Sidebar menu, and defined the Global Market Expansion Workflow in Threads process templates."
    },
    {
      "name": "Top Page Threads Integration",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Replaced the static dashboard on the top page with an LLM interaction screen (threads) based on the reference repository design."
    },
    {
      "name": "Threads Actual Chat Implementation",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Enabled actual LLM conversations in the top page threads by implementing ProcessChatService in the Nexus actor using OpenRouter and LLMRouter. Consolidated redundant thread actors into a single healthy Nexus performer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Thread Actor Consolidation (Nexus)",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Merged 3 separate thread actors (Nexus, Activity, WASM) into a single high-performance Nexus actor for better maintainability and type safety. Resolved Go module dependency issues and implemented a unified ConnectRPC server."
    },
    {
      "name": "MCP Tool Integration for LLM",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Integrated domain-specific tools (Product Manager, Legal Office) into the LLM conversation flow via MCP Gateway, allowing the assistant to perform project management and legal compliance tasks."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Material Insight & Lead Capture Implementation",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Implemented HubSpot-like sales material sharing capability (APQC 3.7.1) with PDF upload, tracking link generation with email capture, and page-level engagement analytics tracking."
    },
    {
      "name": "Capability Constraint Enforcement Fix",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Added missing data-capability attributes to 13 Svelte files to satisfy build-time capability constraints and ensure architectural alignment."
    },
    {
      "name": "Threads Chat Stability & History Persistence",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Fixed initial message saving in Nexus actor, updated ConnectRPC schema to include thread_id in chat requests, and enabled server-side message persistence for LLM responses."
    },
    {
      "name": "UI/UX Integration & Menu Unification",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Consolidated redundant sidebars into a single global navigation system. Integrated 'New Chat', 'New Project', and dynamic thread/project lists into the 'Chat' category of the global sidebar. Enabled selection and actions via query parameters."
    },
    {
      "name": "Performer Migration & Repository Synchronization",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Migrated several specialized submodules from 'actors/' to 'performers/' directory, updated .gitmodules and git metadata (worktree paths), and pushed all changes to origin/main."
    },
    {
      "name": "Product Pitch Sales Material Page Implementation",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Created a high-impact product overview page at /strategy/sales/product-pitch using the design system and interactive mockups to showcase autonomous business reconciliation and AI performers. Enhanced with print-ready styles and comprehensive case studies."
    },
    {
      "name": "Standardized Actor Naming & Finance Capability Integration",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Enforced nanoid suffix rule for all finance and system actors. Registered missing Fixed Asset and Cash Management actors as submodules with proper unique identifiers. Updated capabilities.jsonld and resolved Svelte 5 reactivity warnings."
    },
    {
      "name": "Hierarchical Performer Reorganization",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Reorganized performers into a nested structure (performers/actors, performers/apps, performers/systems) for better scalability and categorization. Updated .meta file and internal project references to reflect new paths."
    },
    {
      "name": "Tooling Consolidation (Meta-only)",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Removed git-repo (Google) dependencies and manifest files, consolidating project management solely on the 'meta' tool for improved simplicity and reduced architectural drift."
    },
    {
      "name": "SES HRSE Integration (Bridge)",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Integrated SES (System Engineering Service) capabilities from etzhayyim-hrse into etzhayyim SvelteKit app. Generated ConnectRPC TS clients for all HRSE services, implemented client-side bridge, and created Svelte 5 UI components for SES Dashboard, BP Management, and Engineer Inventory."
    },
    {
      "name": "SES Email Automation & Deployment",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Implemented end-to-end SES email automation via Resend and OpenAI. Deployed Go backend to [slug].etzhayyim.com with Temporal Schedules for periodic synchronization. Integrated Person/Party Entity Services for cross-platform data consistency."
    },
    {
      "name": "Target Lead Registration & Sales Process Template",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Registered IdealRoute Consulting and Sungrove as target entities in the organization service. Implemented 'Sales Lead Qualification' process template in the Threads system to enable autonomous sales outreach and investigation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Stripe Integration & Resource Entity Mapping",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Implemented Stripe Actor in Go with ConnectRPC for secure payment processing. Refactored frontend to use the Stripe Actor client for product catalog and checkout. Integrated Stripe resources into the global capability map."
    },
    {
      "name": "Legal Office & Compliance APQC Integration",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Integrated Legal Office (APQC 9.2) and Compliance (APQC 9.3) business processes into the core portal. Designed and implemented specialized UI/UX dashboards for autonomous legal advisory, IP management, and compliance monitoring. Unified actor references and updated global navigation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Legal & Compliance UI/UX Components Implementation",
      "status": "Completed",
      "description": "Implemented reusable Svelte 5 components (LegalAdvisoryCard, ComplianceStatusList, IPAssetTable) for the legal-office feature. Refactored legal and compliance dashboards to use these specialized components, ensuring consistent design system alignment and improved maintainability."
    },
    {
      "name": "P-mark PMS Implementation (Issue)",
      "status": "In Progress",
      "description": "Implementation of P-mark (Privacy Mark) Personal Information Protection Management System (PMS). Includes information collection process for business activities, capital, internal audits, management reviews, and document management for PMS manuals, ledgers, and risk analysis results."
    }
